# Markdown is written by hand, not formatted.
#
# Prettier pads every cell of a table to the width of its widest row. Several
# documents here have long cells, so Prettier rewrites those tables into very
# long lines that do not diff well and do not fit in a terminal. It also
# reflows code inside fences, which breaks samples written to match a call
# site.
#
# The ignore is here as well as in the `format` globs, so an editor with
# format-on-save does not undo the rule.
*.md
*.mdx
